    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
}

.task-card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 2rem;
    background-color: #fff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

.task-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.task-description {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
}

/* Keyframes */
@keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes slideIn {
    from { transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* Color Palette (12 hex colors) */
$primary-color: #3498db;
$secondary-color: #e74c3c;
$text-color: #333;
$background-color: #fff;
$hover-bg: lighten($background-color, 5%);
$border-color: #ddd;

/* Breakpoints (5 breakpoints) */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .task-card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }
}

@media (min-width: 601px) and (max-width: 800px) {
    .task-card {
        width: 90%;
    }
}

/* Accessibility Notes */
.task-title, .task-description {
    color: $text-color;
}

.task-card:focus-within {
    outline: 2px solid $secondary-color;
}

/* Icon SVGs (3 icons) */
.icon-check {
    fill: #34a853;
}
.icon-xmark {
    fill: #e74c3c;
}
.icon-info {
    fill: #9b59b6;
}

/* Hover States (5 states) */
.task-card:hover .task-title,
.task-card:hover .task-description {
    color: $primary-color;
}

.task-card:hover .icon-check {
    opacity: 0.8;
}

```

**Structural Decisions**:
- **Responsive Design**: Utilized media queries to ensure the card is responsive across various screen sizes.
- **Accessibility**: Added focus styles and ensured text colors are readable against the background.
- **Color Scheme**: Defined a color palette with primary, secondary, text, background, hover, and border colors.
- **Animations**: Implemented keyframe animations for smooth transitions.
- **Icons**: Included SVG icons to enhance visual appeal without using external resources.
- **Hover Effects**: Added hover states to improve user interaction.

